## AI Tools in This Project

This project supports multiple AI tools. All tools share the same OpenSpec source of truth.

| Tool | Entry Point | Workflow Access |
|---|---|---|
| **Kiro** | `.kiro/steering/` (this folder) | Natural-language instructions → OpenSpec skills |
| **GitHub Copilot** | `.github/copilot-instructions.md` | Slash commands in `.github/prompts/` |
| **Copilot Agents** | `.github/agents/` | Dedicated agent markdown files |

**Canonical AI entry point for all tools: `openspec/AGENTS.md`**

